00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:05.399
studying abroad alone.

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:07.519
He rarely saw us.

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:10.000
I've always felt I owe him.

00:16:22.399 --> 00:16:23.000
Sister Lan,

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:25.559
Chenchen is back from class.

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:27.000
Got it.

00:16:28.879 --> 00:16:29.559
I'll go over first.

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:30.960
Auntie Yu,

00:16:33.559 --> 00:16:34.320
thank you.

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:11.319
What's wrong?

00:17:11.759 --> 00:17:12.279
Sister Yan,

00:17:12.559 --> 00:17:13.119
your application to transfer to

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:14.160
the official host of the family banquet

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:14.960
was rejected again.

00:17:15.319 --> 00:17:16.640
Sun Siwei found out you applied

00:17:16.759 --> 00:17:17.240
and at the director's office

00:17:17.279 --> 00:17:18.319
she really lost her temper.

00:17:18.559 --> 00:17:19.519
You'd better be careful.

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:23.799
This is just the beginning.

00:17:25.359 --> 00:17:26.240
This matter

00:17:28.559 --> 00:17:29.799
is far from settled.

00:17:30.640 --> 00:17:31.240
Yanyan

00:17:31.599 --> 00:17:32.680
come have some fruit.

00:17:40.279 --> 00:17:40.799
Coming.

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:49.240
Here.

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:50.640
Miss Xu,

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:52.400
today went

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:53.359
pretty smoothly.

00:17:54.359 --> 00:17:55.079
I'll handle the check-out procedures

00:17:55.119 --> 00:17:56.160
for you.

00:17:56.799 --> 00:17:57.799
Just leave the room card

00:17:58.039 --> 00:17:59.319
at the front desk tomorrow morning and you can go.

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:01.400
Try not to go out much during this period.

00:18:02.160 --> 00:18:03.400
I'll contact you before the wedding.

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:03.960
After the wedding,

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:05.640
your part will be done.

00:18:06.279 --> 00:18:07.000
After that,

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:09.400
we won't trouble you anymore.

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:10.920
Alright.

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:11.599
Understood, understood.

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:12.839
Don't worry.

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:14.359
We're all just faces for hire.

00:18:14.519 --> 00:18:15.960
Even if you see us on the street

00:18:16.039 --> 00:18:16.599
in the future,

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:17.720
you won't recognize us.

00:18:18.039 --> 00:18:18.680
That's right, that's right.

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:20.200
Since we've

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:21.559
taken this job for you,

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:23.480
we definitely won't cause you any trouble.

00:18:23.640 --> 00:18:24.240
Rest assured.

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:25.240
Yes, exactly.

00:18:26.359 --> 00:18:26.799
Alright.

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:27.440
By the way,

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:28.559
Miss Xu,

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:31.960
take a look at these extras.

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:32.839
I've already

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:34.039
screened them in advance.

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:35.519
See if they can be

00:18:35.720 --> 00:18:36.559
banquet guests.

00:18:37.680 --> 00:18:39.519
You'll get every cent you're owed.

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:42.160
Don't worry about anything else.

00:18:43.559 --> 00:18:44.039
Understood.

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:44.880
Understood, understood.

00:18:49.279 --> 00:18:50.440
Check out before 7 a.m. tomorrow.

00:18:51.279 --> 00:18:51.920
I'm leaving.

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:53.319
Well then,

00:18:53.319 --> 00:18:54.319
Miss Xu, take care.

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:55.200
Take it easy.

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:09.519
A life built on lies—

00:19:10.759 --> 00:19:11.680
I gave it my all

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:12.880
to make it a fortress.

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:15.680
But on the sand,

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:18.039
how can there ever be a castle?

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:37.640
Everything

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:39.480
needs to be sorted and arranged properly.

00:19:40.079 --> 00:19:40.920
The salad ingredients

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:42.119
and what we need for today

00:19:42.359 --> 00:19:43.359
some recipe items

00:19:43.359 --> 00:19:44.599
all need to be organized.

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:46.359
Come on.

00:19:46.759 --> 00:19:47.440
Wash this thoroughly.

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:53.160
Huanhuan

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:55.680
The guest is ready with makeup.

00:19:55.759 --> 00:19:56.960
They've been waiting for over an hour.

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:57.640
Why hasn't Sun Siwei

00:19:57.680 --> 00:19:58.319
arrived yet?

00:19:58.480 --> 00:19:58.759
Sis,

00:19:58.759 --> 00:20:00.000
I've already gone up to remind her twice.

00:20:00.279 --> 00:20:00.720
Then get someone

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:01.640
to invite her, okay?

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:02.079
I...

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:03.960
You were the one who called Sun Siwei.

00:20:08.079 --> 00:20:08.920
Sorry, Siwei.

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:10.480
Why don't we first

00:20:10.519 --> 00:20:12.680
Do you know why you can't replace me

00:20:12.759 --> 00:20:13.960
as the host?

00:20:15.319 --> 00:20:16.839
Because all you do is

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:18.240
play petty tricks behind the scenes.

00:20:18.359 --> 00:20:20.119
It's not presentable at all.

00:20:21.799 --> 00:20:24.200
A planner wants to be a host?

00:20:24.759 --> 00:20:26.440
You should see if you're even qualified.

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:27.880
Besides,

00:20:28.680 --> 00:20:30.680
you can't even handle the planning job.

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:32.119
How is the script written?

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.599
The lines are so awkward, how am I supposed to read them?

00:20:35.240 --> 00:20:36.680
Every time we record,

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:37.200
this script

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:38.480
is useless to me.

00:20:38.519 --> 00:20:39.759
I have to improvise everything.

00:20:40.359 --> 00:20:41.200
The celebrity guests you invite

00:20:41.279 --> 00:20:42.279
get worse every episode.

00:20:42.559 --> 00:20:43.160
The topics you propose

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:44.319
are more boring each time.

00:20:44.359 --> 00:20:44.960
With this,

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:47.400
you still want to be the host?

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:51.759
Siwei,

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:54.319
if there's anything in the script

00:20:54.359 --> 00:20:55.160
you don't like,

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:56.039
I can go and

00:20:56.079 --> 00:20:56.799
change it right now.

00:20:57.160 --> 00:20:57.640
But

00:20:58.720 --> 00:20:59.960
some guests have mentioned

00:21:00.039 --> 00:21:01.440
that the live interview content

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:02.680
doesn't match the script.

00:21:02.799 --> 00:21:03.599
What do you mean?

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:05.279
Are you blaming me now?

00:21:06.559 --> 00:21:07.480
What's wrong?

00:21:07.759 --> 00:21:09.160
I heard you landed a rich boyfriend.

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:11.119
Think you can turn your life around now?

00:21:15.759 --> 00:21:18.319
You'd better know your place.

00:21:19.799 --> 00:21:21.079
People like them

00:21:21.559 --> 00:21:22.759
have a shelf life for relationships

00:21:22.799 --> 00:21:24.119
of just a month or two.

00:21:25.920 --> 00:21:27.359
If you have energy to spare,

00:21:27.400 --> 00:21:29.319
use it to please me instead.

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:31.960
I'm in charge of this show.

00:21:32.759 --> 00:21:34.880
One word from me and you're out.

00:21:37.640 --> 00:21:38.880
Why hasn't the guest arrived yet?

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:43.160
The weekly ratings report is out.

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:45.400
See for yourself.

00:21:48.319 --> 00:21:49.039
Director Zhou,

00:21:50.599 --> 00:21:52.039
the ratings for this episode are low.

00:21:52.119 --> 00:21:53.039
I take responsibility.

00:21:53.400 --> 00:21:54.599
Regarding the guest,

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:56.799
I've communicated with the host.

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:58.200
But she...

00:22:00.240 --> 00:22:01.880
So could you please

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:02.839
talk to her?

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:03.599
Xiao Xu,

00:22:04.119 --> 00:22:05.480
I understand your difficulties.

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:06.920
But a show

00:22:06.960 --> 00:22:09.000
needs everyone's cooperation.

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:12.200
As the planner, you need to see the bigger picture.

00:22:13.160 --> 00:22:14.160
Am I right?

00:22:14.519 --> 00:22:15.759
Have you decided on the next guest?

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:17.240
Yes.

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:20.319
I'm contacting the founder of Sanmu Art Museum

00:22:20.359 --> 00:22:21.880
Mr. Sanmu.

00:22:22.359 --> 00:22:23.519
Inviting him to the show.

00:22:25.759 --> 00:22:26.480
He agreed to come.

00:22:27.160 --> 00:22:28.440
Mr. Sanmu is very interested.

00:22:28.640 --> 00:22:29.759
He wants to check

00:22:29.960 --> 00:22:30.599
the full schedule.

00:22:30.599 --> 00:22:31.799
So it's not confirmed yet.

00:22:32.640 --> 00:22:33.319
Xu Yan,

00:22:34.039 --> 00:22:35.359
you've worked here for a long time.

00:22:35.480 --> 00:22:36.920
You should know very well

00:22:37.240 --> 00:22:39.200
you're the planner for the Family Banquet show.

00:22:39.400 --> 00:22:42.240
Your job is to plan the show well.

00:22:42.440 --> 00:22:43.359
Build a lineup

00:22:43.359 --> 00:22:45.119
of guests the audience loves.

00:22:46.079 --> 00:22:47.079
As for becoming the host,

00:22:47.799 --> 00:22:49.319
haste makes waste.

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:52.559
Let me remind you,

00:22:53.359 --> 00:22:55.359
if next week's ratings drop again,

00:22:58.039 --> 00:22:59.279
management will consider your position.

00:22:59.279 --> 00:23:00.000
They'll be making a decision.

00:23:16.440 --> 00:23:17.240
I'm not done yet.

00:23:18.240 --> 00:23:19.400
The guest for the next episode

00:23:19.440 --> 00:23:20.480
isn't confirmed.

00:23:20.519 --> 00:23:21.200
So

00:23:21.759 --> 00:23:23.240
all scripts need to be backed up.

00:23:37.400 --> 00:23:39.079
I've been contacting him for a long time.

00:23:40.680 --> 00:23:41.240
Mr. Sanmu

00:23:41.279 --> 00:23:42.799
is a friend I met in London.

00:23:44.279 --> 00:23:45.039
This art museum

00:23:45.039 --> 00:23:46.240
is his private collection.

00:23:47.319 --> 00:23:48.319
I've arranged for you to meet him.

00:23:48.720 --> 00:23:49.559
He'll get in touch with you.

00:23:51.079 --> 00:23:51.960
Thank you.

00:23:52.000 --> 00:23:52.680
You're welcome.

00:23:53.799 --> 00:23:54.799
Let me note it down too.

00:23:54.799 --> 00:23:55.720
His phone number.

00:24:00.839 --> 00:24:01.519
How did you know

00:24:01.519 --> 00:24:02.720
my work schedule?

00:24:07.960 --> 00:24:09.039
Because on your side

00:24:09.720 --> 00:24:10.759
I have an informant.

00:24:26.440 --> 00:24:27.079
By the way,

00:24:28.720 --> 00:24:29.880
I wanted to ask you,

00:24:33.279 --> 00:24:35.640
your parents met my family yesterday.

00:24:36.680 --> 00:24:37.759
What did they think?

00:24:42.920 --> 00:24:44.200
No matter what they think,

00:24:45.519 --> 00:24:46.680
I'm very satisfied.

00:25:07.319 --> 00:25:08.440
Do you really love me?

00:25:10.559 --> 00:25:11.160
Of course.

00:25:13.799 --> 00:25:14.559
What do you love about me?

00:25:15.400 --> 00:25:16.000
Everything.

00:25:18.440 --> 00:25:19.400
I know very well

00:25:20.279 --> 00:25:21.240
that this man in front of me

00:25:21.240 --> 00:25:22.240
fulfills all my

00:25:22.279 --> 00:25:23.240
expectations of a husband.

00:25:37.640 --> 00:25:38.799
I love Shen Haoming.

00:25:40.240 --> 00:25:41.119
He's the first

00:25:41.119 --> 00:25:42.680
to make me truly feel

00:25:43.720 --> 00:25:44.279
loved

00:25:44.720 --> 00:25:46.400
and chosen without hesitation.

00:25:48.839 --> 00:25:50.480
No matter how many obstacles there are,

00:25:52.119 --> 00:25:54.160
I will hold on tightly to this love.

00:26:18.519 --> 00:26:18.920
Morning.

00:26:19.319 --> 00:26:19.960
Good morning.

00:26:26.640 --> 00:26:27.119
Sister Yan

00:26:27.480 --> 00:26:28.680
Here's the proposal you asked for yesterday.

00:26:28.759 --> 00:26:29.400
Thank you.

00:26:29.920 --> 00:26:30.839
There's one more thing.

00:26:31.279 --> 00:26:32.359
That trendy plant brand,

00:26:32.400 --> 00:26:33.319
the owner of the themed store,

00:26:33.480 --> 00:26:34.480
is all about being mysterious.

00:26:34.759 --> 00:26:35.680
I've tried calling,

00:26:35.839 --> 00:26:36.400
emailing,

00:26:36.480 --> 00:26:38.119
and even visiting in person, but all were refused.

00:26:38.240 --> 00:26:39.759
They won't accept any interviews.

00:26:40.480 --> 00:26:42.200
We're filming in two days.

00:26:42.359 --> 00:26:43.039
What should we do?

00:26:47.279 --> 00:26:48.599
Let me figure something out. Don't worry.

00:26:48.759 --> 00:26:49.599
I'm counting on you.

00:27:48.400 --> 00:27:48.880
This way.

00:27:57.279 --> 00:27:57.960
Please come this way.

00:28:02.240 --> 00:28:03.160
Watch your step.

00:28:24.200 --> 00:28:24.799
Be careful.

00:29:04.720 --> 00:29:05.519
Hello, boss.

00:29:06.119 --> 00:29:07.640
I'm here for the interview today.

00:29:07.960 --> 00:29:08.559
Amy.

00:29:11.240 --> 00:29:12.400
Take the agave on the table

00:29:12.599 --> 00:29:13.359
trim the roots and repot it.

00:29:16.039 --> 00:29:16.640
Okay.

00:29:21.559 --> 00:29:22.599
Your resume says

00:29:23.079 --> 00:29:24.519
you've worked with agave for a long time.

00:29:24.720 --> 00:29:25.799
Actually, not that long.

00:29:26.759 --> 00:29:28.519
Compared to you, boss,

00:29:29.119 --> 00:29:30.480
I'm nothing in comparison.

00:29:31.039 --> 00:29:32.839
Not many women like agave.

00:29:33.480 --> 00:29:34.720
Why are you interested in it?

00:29:38.480 --> 00:29:40.240
Because it has extraordinary vitality.

00:29:41.720 --> 00:29:43.079
It's an artist of the earth.

00:29:43.359 --> 00:29:44.480
A masterpiece a hundred million years in the making.

00:29:51.799 --> 00:29:53.160
It existed alongside dinosaurs.

00:29:53.640 --> 00:29:55.240
It grows among rocks and mountains.

00:29:55.960 --> 00:29:57.119
Enduring wind and rain.

00:29:58.039 --> 00:29:59.119
Its shape

00:29:59.559 --> 00:30:01.640
is similar to the legendary dragon's tongue.

00:30:01.799 --> 00:30:02.599
Very much alike.

00:30:04.000 --> 00:30:05.359
But most importantly,

00:30:07.279 --> 00:30:08.440
I can make it

00:30:08.880 --> 00:30:10.559
grow the way I want.

00:30:20.079 --> 00:30:22.200
Every plant cultivator

00:30:22.839 --> 00:30:24.400
has their own perspective.

00:30:25.119 --> 00:30:26.480
Some people prefer

00:30:27.000 --> 00:30:27.880
natural growth.

00:30:28.799 --> 00:30:29.920
Others

00:30:30.079 --> 00:30:32.200
like to control it artificially.

00:30:32.759 --> 00:30:34.240
My view is

00:30:36.480 --> 00:30:37.920
I must make it grow into

00:30:38.039 --> 00:30:39.200
the shape I like.

00:30:53.559 --> 00:30:55.000
So I use strong light

00:30:55.000 --> 00:30:56.519
to limit its leaf growth.

00:30:57.160 --> 00:30:59.480
I control the frequency of fertilizing and watering,

00:30:59.960 --> 00:31:01.920
as well as soil and ventilation.

00:31:02.960 --> 00:31:04.559
Every tiny change in it

00:31:05.000 --> 00:31:05.839
must

00:31:05.880 --> 00:31:07.200
be within my control.

00:31:07.599 --> 00:31:08.640
Because only then

00:31:08.920 --> 00:31:10.640
can it reach its full potential.

00:31:11.559 --> 00:31:12.720
Start work tomorrow.

00:31:18.480 --> 00:31:19.079
Okay.

00:31:20.480 --> 00:31:21.920
But if you work here,

00:31:23.599 --> 00:31:24.839
what about your other job?

00:31:24.960 --> 00:31:25.519
Miss Xu,

00:31:35.359 --> 00:31:36.240
Miss Xu Yan,

00:31:36.880 --> 00:31:38.079
you're very smart.

00:31:39.480 --> 00:31:41.319
Your show is well done.

00:31:42.759 --> 00:31:43.759
Your acting is top-notch.

00:31:45.400 --> 00:31:46.519
To get close to me,

00:31:47.880 --> 00:31:49.000
you learned so much

00:31:49.079 --> 00:31:50.160
about agave.

00:31:51.079 --> 00:31:51.920
You even practiced

00:31:52.359 --> 00:31:53.599
how to cultivate it.

00:31:54.759 --> 00:31:56.519
You kept it all secret quite well.

00:31:58.359 --> 00:32:00.599
From your clothes and resume,

00:32:02.359 --> 00:32:03.039
an ordinary person

00:32:03.839 --> 00:32:05.559
would never know you're pretending.

00:32:06.640 --> 00:32:07.519
But unfortunately,

00:32:12.319 --> 00:32:13.079
you kept contacting

00:32:13.119 --> 00:32:14.480
our assistant Huanhuan.

00:32:15.240 --> 00:32:16.160
On Weibo,

00:32:17.079 --> 00:32:18.240
she posted a photo of you two.

00:32:26.920 --> 00:32:28.519
But your views on agave

00:32:30.519 --> 00:32:31.359
really moved me.

00:32:32.559 --> 00:32:33.519
Still, as I said before,

00:32:34.440 --> 00:32:36.160
I won't accept any interviews.

00:32:37.319 --> 00:32:38.119
Please go home.

00:32:44.119 --> 00:32:45.599
I'm very sorry, Mr. Shen.

00:32:47.000 --> 00:32:47.720
For

00:32:49.920 --> 00:32:52.119
meeting you in this way.

00:32:53.400 --> 00:32:54.319
Regarding the interview,

00:32:55.720 --> 00:32:56.920
I respect your

00:32:58.559 --> 00:32:59.720
decision.

00:33:02.640 --> 00:33:03.880
But before this,

00:33:03.960 --> 00:33:05.480
I prepared a gift for you.

00:33:05.599 --> 00:33:06.680
I wanted to give it to you in person.

00:33:13.000 --> 00:33:14.480
A famous botanist,

00:33:14.480 --> 00:33:15.359
Professor Yiding,

00:33:15.480 --> 00:33:16.799
personally made these scissors.

00:33:17.519 --> 00:33:18.640
They should

00:33:19.720 --> 00:33:21.119
match your taste.

00:33:22.720 --> 00:33:23.119
Miss,

00:33:23.279 --> 00:33:24.640
You've been here many times.

00:33:24.759 --> 00:33:26.519
Still haven't found one you like?

00:33:27.839 --> 00:33:29.240
I'm indecisive.

00:33:29.640 --> 00:33:30.279
I'll look a bit more.

00:33:30.359 --> 00:33:31.119
No problem.

00:33:31.240 --> 00:33:32.000
Take your time.

00:33:32.039 --> 00:33:33.039
Let me know if you need anything.

00:33:33.119 --> 00:33:33.559
Thank you.

00:33:35.880 --> 00:33:36.799
So careless.

00:33:37.240 --> 00:33:38.519
Quick, take it to the back.

00:33:42.319 --> 00:33:42.920
Um...

00:33:44.279 --> 00:33:44.920
Let me help you.

00:33:44.920 --> 00:33:45.480
Yes, yes.

00:33:45.480 --> 00:33:45.839
I'll help you.

00:33:46.000 --> 00:33:46.880
If this gets lost,

00:33:46.920 --> 00:33:47.440
our boss

00:33:47.480 --> 00:33:48.640
would definitely fire me.

00:33:50.440 --> 00:33:51.400
Is it really that important?

00:33:51.920 --> 00:33:52.559
You have no idea.

00:33:52.680 --> 00:33:53.680
This is our boss's

00:33:53.720 --> 00:33:54.640
personal soil fork.

00:33:54.880 --> 00:33:55.960
Made by Professor Yiding.

00:33:56.200 --> 00:33:57.200
It's very precious.

00:34:08.360 --> 00:34:09.440
Looks like you really

00:34:10.119 --> 00:34:11.400
did your homework on me.

00:34:11.840 --> 00:34:12.719
But

00:34:14.159 --> 00:34:15.280
it doesn't seem to help much.

00:34:15.960 --> 00:34:17.039
Don't say that.

00:34:19.039 --> 00:34:20.400
Such a valuable limited edition,

00:34:20.480 --> 00:34:21.400
and you managed to find it.

00:34:22.840 --> 00:34:24.880
Shows you put in a lot of effort.

00:34:25.960 --> 00:34:27.400
I have a gift for you too.

00:34:32.559 --> 00:34:33.760
Thank you, Mr. Shen.

00:34:35.760 --> 00:34:36.719
Open it and take a look.

00:34:45.320 --> 00:34:46.559
Is it a coincidence?

00:34:47.039 --> 00:34:47.840
Of course not.

00:34:56.960 --> 00:34:58.440
Everything I do

00:35:00.199 --> 00:35:02.199
is under Mr. Shen's control.

00:35:03.280 --> 00:35:04.320
Such a beautiful person

00:35:04.360 --> 00:35:05.400
often comes to my shop.

00:35:06.639 --> 00:35:08.039
How could that not attract attention?

00:35:10.480 --> 00:35:12.480
I thought I was being discreet.

00:35:13.679 --> 00:35:15.199
I didn't expect you had allowed it.

00:35:17.000 --> 00:35:18.599
Mr. Shen likes

00:35:19.079 --> 00:35:20.639
to take the initiative, right?

00:35:21.960 --> 00:35:23.480
I've read your articles online.

00:35:27.039 --> 00:35:28.480
My grandma has poor eyesight.

00:35:29.119 --> 00:35:30.119
But early in the morning,

00:35:30.480 --> 00:35:32.039
she starts collecting osmanthus flowers.

00:35:33.360 --> 00:35:34.960
When I come home from school,

00:35:35.719 --> 00:35:36.679
from a distance,

00:35:37.199 --> 00:35:39.679
I see her through the window.

00:35:41.800 --> 00:35:43.000
Wearing reading glasses,

00:35:44.280 --> 00:35:46.199
she bakes the flower petals.

00:35:47.679 --> 00:35:48.639
She told me

00:35:50.119 --> 00:35:51.559
if the season passes,

00:35:52.599 --> 00:35:53.960
osmanthus jam won't be sweet anymore.

00:35:55.880 --> 00:35:57.360
If your grandma

00:35:57.719 --> 00:36:00.400
also made osmanthus jam for you,

00:36:02.400 --> 00:36:03.360
I don't think

00:36:03.920 --> 00:36:05.840
you would have a lonely heart.

00:36:12.800 --> 00:36:15.039
Your writing is full of emotion.

00:36:15.880 --> 00:36:17.000
It really moved me.

00:36:18.880 --> 00:36:19.800
I believe

00:36:21.519 --> 00:36:23.199
you must love osmanthus jam.

00:36:36.400 --> 00:36:37.280
What?

00:36:37.719 --> 00:36:38.960
You were found out.

00:36:40.599 --> 00:36:41.920
Did he give you a hard time?

00:36:43.639 --> 00:36:44.880
No, he didn't.

00:36:46.679 --> 00:36:48.360
But he still refused the interview.

00:36:49.719 --> 00:36:50.880
He's really stubborn.

00:36:54.159 --> 00:36:55.320
I wouldn't say that.

00:36:55.840 --> 00:36:56.880
Maybe

00:36:57.400 --> 00:36:59.119
he has his own difficulties.

00:36:59.360 --> 00:37:00.000
Or

00:37:00.400 --> 00:37:01.000
Wait a minute.

00:37:07.679 --> 00:37:08.400
Yan,

00:37:08.800 --> 00:37:09.800
are you catching a cold?

00:37:10.079 --> 00:37:11.079
You need to take care of yourself.

00:37:11.199 --> 00:37:11.840
Get some rest early.

00:37:11.920 --> 00:37:12.599
I know.

00:37:12.760 --> 00:37:13.320
I'm hanging up.

00:38:03.800 --> 00:38:04.360
Yan,

00:38:04.639 --> 00:38:06.000
You look worse and worse.

00:38:06.119 --> 00:38:07.199
Go home and rest.

00:38:07.920 --> 00:38:08.559
I can handle it.

00:38:12.639 --> 00:38:13.639
Then take care of yourself.

00:38:13.960 --> 00:38:15.039
Call me if you need anything.

00:38:18.360 --> 00:38:18.920
Xu Yan,

00:38:21.039 --> 00:38:22.119
the owner of the trendy plant shop.

00:38:22.159 --> 00:38:23.000
Did you interview him?

00:38:23.559 --> 00:38:24.280
Sorry,

00:38:24.960 --> 00:38:25.920
I haven't had the chance yet.

00:38:26.079 --> 00:38:27.199
Not yet.

00:38:27.800 --> 00:38:29.000
The show is about to start recording.

00:38:29.039 --> 00:38:30.199
How long do you want to wait?

00:38:34.119 --> 00:38:34.599
I'll do it as soon as possible.

00:38:34.639 --> 00:38:35.320
What do you mean?

00:38:35.880 --> 00:38:36.360
Sick.

00:38:36.599 --> 00:38:37.360
Don't want to work anymore.

00:38:37.519 --> 00:38:38.480
Want to go home and rest.

00:38:39.400 --> 00:38:40.079
Alright.

00:38:40.840 --> 00:38:42.280
Go settle your salary.

00:38:42.320 --> 00:38:43.480
Then rest at home for good.

00:38:43.760 --> 00:38:45.239
Don't say I didn't warn you.

00:38:45.559 --> 00:38:46.880
I told you last week.

00:38:47.039 --> 00:38:48.360
If the director blames you,

00:38:48.400 --> 00:38:49.280
it's not my responsibility.

00:39:03.159 --> 00:39:03.920
I have time today

00:39:03.960 --> 00:39:05.119
to accept your interview.

00:39:10.480 --> 00:39:11.599
Come find me at Jinda Group.

00:39:12.239 --> 00:39:13.719
Please contact Casey at the front desk.

00:39:15.880 --> 00:39:16.920
Jinda Group.

00:39:27.559 --> 00:39:28.159
Hello.

00:39:28.840 --> 00:39:30.280
I have an appointment with Mr. Shen Haoming.

00:39:30.320 --> 00:39:30.880
Excuse me,

00:39:30.920 --> 00:39:31.400
Hello.

00:39:31.599 --> 00:39:32.559
Are you Miss Xu?

00:39:32.639 --> 00:39:34.199
Mr. Shen is waiting for you upstairs.

00:39:34.239 --> 00:39:34.880
Please follow me.

00:39:35.559 --> 00:39:36.079
Yueyue,

00:39:37.400 --> 00:39:37.920
This way.

00:39:40.199 --> 00:39:40.960
Sorry.

00:39:41.000 --> 00:39:42.079
I just want to confirm

00:39:42.920 --> 00:39:44.519
the Mr. Shen you mentioned

00:39:44.639 --> 00:39:45.440
is the one I'm looking for,

00:39:45.440 --> 00:39:46.519
Mr. Shen Haoming?

00:39:46.639 --> 00:39:47.159
Yes.

00:39:47.199 --> 00:39:47.840
Mr. Shen

00:39:47.880 --> 00:39:49.360
is our group's Vice President.

00:39:49.400 --> 00:39:51.000
He's also Chairman Shen's eldest son.

00:40:00.039 --> 00:40:00.719
This way, please.

00:40:08.599 --> 00:40:09.039
Please.

00:40:28.920 --> 00:40:30.079
Then come back here.

00:40:31.920 --> 00:40:32.519
Miss Xu,

00:40:33.000 --> 00:40:34.000
Mr. Shen is in a meeting.

00:40:34.159 --> 00:40:35.320
Please wait here for a moment.